ck":"b-57e4a40906a35cb81cc2","layer":"original","quote":"徙威烈将军〖8〗，封都亭侯","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":68,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-5e912039169623726e29","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-5ecb4d52b1b6c18777c8","layer":"original","quote":"后拜荡寇中郎将〖6〗，领零陵太守。从讨刘勋于寻阳，进攻黄祖于沙羡，还镇石城","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":164,"end":201,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-856c07254e003d5930e3","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-57e4a40906a35cb81cc2","layer":"original","quote":"曹真攻南郡〖9〗，当保东南〖10〗，在外为帅，厉将士同心固守。又敬望督司〖11〗，奉遵法令：权善之","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":82,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-908f758fb3c473b00b86","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-1e1b34c4f03bb4b52e78","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《吴书》曰：“当勤苦有功；以军旅陪隶，分于英豪，故爵位不加。终于坚世，为别部司马。”","attribution":"《吴书》","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":79,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-be24459d319aca60973a","start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-a003c8918a5212f53d16","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-6e065f863aa07d3bea95","layer":"original","quote":"后又加“都督”之号。","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-a02be78253a3ab88f059","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-57e4a40906a35cb81cc2","layer":"original","quote":"又与吕蒙袭取南郡。","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-a1970ba8acfd65577e93","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-ac3d85213e7994859abe","layer":"original","quote":"从征刘勋，破黄祖；还讨鄱阳，领乐安长，山越畏服","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-a5ca7bf5886dfc0c3c23","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-8df5fbfa238257957a6b","layer":"original","quote":"将敢死及解烦兵万人〖13〗，讨丹杨贼，破之。会病卒","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-ccaf97c08c0dc5efcb47","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-a924da4d7610a3a3e590","layer":"pei","quote":"赤壁之役，盖为流矢所中。时寒，堕水，为吴军人所得；不知其盖也，置厕床中。盖自强以一声呼韩当，当闻之，曰：‘此公覆声也！’向之垂涕，解易其衣，遂以得生","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cc9cee94734e61ac2a77","start":10,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-ddf0c01e9bdfc1bbc2f6","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-61e6d5c83565e03f535e","layer":"original","quote":"从征伐周旋，数犯危难，陷敌擒虏。为别部司马","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-e051c4a4302e4a7690c4","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-57e4a40906a35cb81cc2","layer":"original","quote":"后以中郎将与周瑜等拒破曹公，又与吕蒙袭取南郡。","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-f7bdf51d4254af566977","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-61e6d5c83565e03f535e","layer":"original","quote":"韩当字义公，辽西令支人也〖1〗。","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-ff11ebadb0830dc0d855","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-ac3d85213e7994859abe","layer":"original","quote":"及孙策东渡，从讨三郡；迁先登校尉〖4〗，授兵二千，骑五十匹","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。马超的祠墓遗址，相传在今四川成都市新都区城南的马超小学内，曾有墓碑出土。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1fcace810489e51a4218","start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o034","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-7ddd1fa08ce5c9feb1d4","layer":"original","quote":"二年卒〖13〗，时年四十七。临没上疏曰：“臣门宗二百余口〖14〗，为孟德所诛略尽〖15〗；惟有从弟岱，当为微宗血食之继〖16〗，深托陛下。余无复言。”","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-0969af22177c0d34bef3","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"权遣数万人乘船屯舒口〖21〗，分兵救兰；闻霸军在舒，遁还","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":91,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-65609a4314c327416cc6","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"当复遣兵邀霸于夹石，与战，破之，还屯舒","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":67,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-9f0ea2d46605029e516e","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"当遣兵逆霸，霸与战于逢龙","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-bdd70f228a9ccac98fc5","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"霸别遣至皖，讨吴将韩当〖18〗，使权不得救兰","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-e5e222d5085d2aebbcde","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"霸夜追之，比明，行百余里，邀贼，前后击之；贼窘急，不得上船，赴水者甚众","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":120,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o016a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-91a1c767b310bb1e937f","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年，刘备率大众来向西界。权命逊为大都督，假节，督朱然、潘璋、宋谦、韩当、徐盛、鲜于丹、孙桓等五万人拒之〖5〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o016","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-91a1c767b310bb1e937f","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年，刘备率大众来向西界。权命逊为大都督，假节，督朱然、潘璋、宋谦、韩当、徐盛、鲜于丹、孙桓等五万人拒之〖5〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o027","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-6b23f8730a9cef243526","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮与正，虽好尚不同〖31〗，以公义相取〖32〗；亮每奇正智术。先主既即尊号，将东征孙权以复关羽之耻，群臣多谏，一不从。章武二年，大军败绩，还住白帝。亮叹曰：“法孝直若在，则能制主上，令不东行；就复东行，必不倾危矣！”﹝四﹞","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p047a-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-f9a911c6b81ca23bec0b","layer":"pei","quote":"臣讨黄祖，以十二月八日到祖所屯沙羡县。刘表遣将助祖，并来趋臣。臣以十一日平旦，部所领江夏太守、行建威中郎将周瑜，领桂阳太守、行征虏中郎将吕范，领零陵太守、行荡寇中郎将程普，行奉（业）〔义〕校尉孙权，行先登校尉韩当，行武锋校尉黄盖等，同时俱进。","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-344fcece1d1f127d763a","start":10,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p047","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-f9a911c6b81ca23bec0b","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》载策表曰：“臣讨黄祖，以十二月八日到祖所屯沙羡县。刘表遣将助祖，并来趋臣。臣以十一日平旦，部所领江夏太守、行建威中郎将周瑜，领桂阳太守、行征虏中郎将吕范，领零陵太守、行荡寇中郎将程普，行奉（业）〔义〕校尉孙权，行先登校尉韩当，行武锋校尉黄盖等，同时俱进。身跨马綝阵，手击急鼓，以齐战势；吏士奋激，踊跃百倍，心精意果，各竞用命。越渡重堑，迅疾若飞；火放上风，兵激烟下；弓弩并发，流矢雨集；日加辰时，祖乃溃烂。锋刃所截，猋火所焚；前无生寇，惟祖迸走。获其妻、息男女七人，斩虎（狼）、韩晞以下二万余级，其赴水溺者一万余口；船六千余艘，财物山积。虽表未擒，祖宿狡猾，为表腹心，出作爪牙；表之鸱张，以祖气息；而祖家属部曲，扫地无余；表孤特之虏，成鬼行尸。诚皆圣朝，神武远振，臣讨有罪，得效微勤。”","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-344fcece1d1f127d763a","start":0,"end":347,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51bced16741add42ff70","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：建安四年（公元 199）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20628d34a709162c77f0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o061","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，公还至昌邑〖2〗。张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-9dfc26d83bc6f0a49854","layer":"original","quote":"建安四年，从策征庐江太守刘勋。勋破，进讨黄祖于沙羡〖1〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o008b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7adf6fb487c32ced7646","layer":"original","quote":"使吕范平鄱阳（会稽）〖22〗，程普讨乐安〖23〗；太史慈领海昏〖24〗，韩当、周泰、吕蒙等，为剧县令、长〖25〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o003","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-9dfc26d83bc6f0a49854","layer":"original","quote":"建安四年，从策征庐江太守刘勋。勋破，进讨黄祖于沙羡〖1〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":15,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o008","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7adf6fb487c32ced7646","layer":"original","quote":"八年〖20〗，权西伐黄祖，破其舟军，惟城未克；而山寇复动〖21〗，还过豫章，使吕范平鄱阳（会稽）〖22〗，程普讨乐安〖23〗；太史慈领海昏〖24〗，韩当、周泰、吕蒙等，为剧县令、长〖25〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o054","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7e0fdf82962252602cbd","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年春正月〖1〗，陆逊部将军宋谦等〖2〗，攻蜀五屯；皆破之，斩其将。三月，鄱阳言黄龙现〖3〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o014","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-9236c229b2cd9315f1e3","layer":"original","quote":"袁术欲经徐州北就袁绍，曹公遣先主督朱灵、路招要击术〖4〗。未至，术病死。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-ee371e4d38e13efa88cd","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗八年：建安八年（公元 203）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-89fa02f36b1a0d0955da","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o023","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-64b6e45c68fb16b80ee9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖复次于河上，绍病死。太祖渡河，击绍子谭、尚。而高幹、郭援侵略河东，关右震动。钟繇帅马腾等，击破之，语在《繇传》。八年〖4〗，太祖录彧前后功，表封彧为万岁亭侯。﹝一﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-d7d4aca1e2d1cfd99607","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-db9521ca359ae78fa90e","layer":"original","quote":"时独与一骑，猝遇策。策从骑十三，皆韩当、宋谦、黄盖辈也〖20〗。慈便前斗，正与策对。策刺慈马，而揽得慈项上手戟〖21〗；慈亦得策兜鍪〖22〗。会两家兵骑并各来赴，于是解散","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":89,"end":174,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o007a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-540c45abdbf8dfcd0bc0","layer":"original","quote":"陈兰、梅成以（氐）〔灊〕、六县叛〖2〗。太祖遣于禁、臧霸等讨成，辽督张郃、牛盖等讨兰。成伪降禁，禁还；成遂将其众就兰，转入灊山〖3〗。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"sunshi-p0074":{"fields":[{"id":"sunshi-p0074-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"义公","evidence":["chenghuang-q-f7bdf51d4254af566977"]}],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
